 * One team member's social links, in the same visual voice as
 * SocialLinks (inherits color/font from the parent wrapper). Rendered
 * on the About page cards and the /about/{person} pages.
 *
 * Placeholder entries (captain hasn't supplied the URL yet) render
 * visually complete with href="#" and no target — see the TODO in
 * src/lib/team.ts. Real links open in a new tab like SocialLinks does.
 *
 * Icon paths are the official simple-icons marks (CC0), matching the
 * Instagram/TikTok glyph style already used by SocialLinks.
